size: 16px;"><span>I&#8217;m one of them. So is Brian Halligan, the former =
CEO of HubSpot and now partner at Sequoia, who revealed he&#8217;d built an=
 AI agent trained on his entire life that now attends his Zoom meetings. He=
 calls it &#8216;</span><a href=3D"https://substack.com/redirect/7789da89-9=
