think, and what you&#8217;ve learned, then let it compound that knowledge o=
ver time.</p><p style=3D"margin: 0 0 20px 0;color: rgb(54,55,55);line-heigh=
t: 26px;font-size: 16px;">For those following me, you know I&#8217;ve been =
